- They look good on me, I'm beautiful.


00:38:07.535 --> 00:38:10.129
Did granny give them to you today?
- Yes.


00:38:41.202 --> 00:38:43.694
Buy me a drink, you promised.


00:38:49.110 --> 00:38:51.101
Still trying?


00:38:51.880 --> 00:38:53.780
You never feel ashamed?


00:38:57.151 --> 00:38:59.085
Thanks a lot.


00:39:14.702 --> 00:39:17.535
He's my boyfriend, he's joking.


00:39:17.739 --> 00:39:19.138
Just joking, right?


00:39:19.541 --> 00:39:22.442
Tina... Tina's here!


00:39:24.512 --> 00:39:26.378
First they never want to kiss you,


00:39:26.581 --> 00:39:28.549
then they suck you as strong as a mule


00:39:28.750 --> 00:39:30.616
as if they wanted to swallow you.


00:39:30.852 --> 00:39:32.911
That's what love is, isn't it?


00:39:34.589 --> 00:39:37.115
Giacomino, give me a shot of myrtle.


00:39:37.492 --> 00:39:39.392
My friend's paying.


00:39:40.461 --> 00:39:42.020
She's paying.


00:39:42.230 --> 00:39:43.561
Yes.


00:39:45.466 --> 00:39:48.060
Giacomino doesn't like to talk.


00:39:48.736 --> 00:39:52.434
He likes other things though.
Right, Giacomino?


00:39:53.474 --> 00:39:55.875
But he always cries after,


00:39:56.578 --> 00:39:58.512
because of his wife.


00:40:00.481 --> 00:40:03.473
Maybe that's why he can't love me.


00:40:03.985 --> 00:40:06.784
We could've been happy together, right?


00:40:09.223 --> 00:40:13.751
Giacomino's had a wife for 16 years!


00:40:14.596 --> 00:40:17.031
I've got nothing against his wife.


00:40:17.532 --> 00:40:20.160
Has she got something against me?


00:40:20.802 --> 00:40:22.793
She's the wife!


00:40:23.471 --> 00:40:24.802
We should be friends


00:40:25.039 --> 00:40:27.030
since we want the same thing.


00:40:32.981 --> 00:40:35.450
You can't see Vittoria anymore.


00:40:38.252 --> 00:40:40.812
Why can't I see her anymore?


00:40:41.055 --> 00:40:42.921
Because we had an agreement.


00:40:43.124 --> 00:40:45.923
We also agreed you'd always help me.


00:40:46.127 --> 00:40:47.686
I've always helped you.


00:40:47.929 --> 00:40:49.954
But they're taking away my home.


00:40:50.164 --> 00:40:52.599
You know there's nothing I can do.


00:40:54.802 --> 00:40:56.270
Vittoria's mine.


00:40:57.605 --> 00:41:02.509
Because I gave her to you.


00:41:04.012 --> 00:41:05.502
That's right.


00:41:06.514 --> 00:41:08.676
That's right, you gave her to me.


00:41:09.951 --> 00:41:12.477
It was the right thing, for everyone.


00:41:12.687 --> 00:41:13.916
You know.


00:41:14.555 --> 00:41:16.045
It's better like this.


00:41:19.794 --> 00:41:22.456
You've never wanted her, never.


00:41:23.898 --> 00:41:25.923
You've never wanted her.


00:41:28.569 --> 00:41:30.503
She came on her own.


00:41:30.838 --> 00:41:33.500
She came to look for me.


00:41:33.708 --> 00:41:35.767
She said you knew.


00:41:36.077 --> 00:41:38.045
And she also came back.


00:41:39.113 --> 00:41:43.448
She came back
because she likes being with me.


00:41:47.822 --> 00:41:48.532
Wait...


00:41:48.556 --> 00:41:49.455
Wait...


00:41:49.657 --> 00:41:51.125
Giacomino!


00:41:52.660 --> 00:41:54.924
Buy me another shot?
- Yes.


00:41:55.229 --> 00:41:57.527
She's paying for another.


00:42:00.568 --> 00:42:02.468
When's your ticket for?


00:42:06.174 --> 00:42:07.505
When?


00:42:09.844 --> 00:42:11.608
Listen to me...


00:42:14.148 --> 00:42:15.741
Listen to me.


00:42:16.084 --> 00:42:17.779
Leave!


00:42:18.519 --> 00:42:22.183
Go to a beautiful, different place,


00:42:22.557 --> 00:42:24.457
a fun place.


00:42:26.694 --> 00:42:28.753
You know what you have to do?


00:42:31.065 --> 00:42:32.863
What did I tell you?


00:42:36.204 --> 00:42:38.434
I have to sell the animals.


00:42:38.639 --> 00:42:40.733
Yes, sell them all!


00:42:40.975 --> 00:42:44.605
Make some money before you go.


00:42:47.115 --> 00:42:49.914
Umberto and I will always help you.


00:42:50.118 --> 00:42:51.711
Always.


00:42:54.822 --> 00:42:56.984
You see, I love you.


00:42:58.726 --> 00:43:00.023
Yes.


00:43:03.664 --> 00:43:05.598
You love me.
- Yes.


00:43:13.808 --> 00:43:15.833
Do you want me to take you home?


00:43:16.077 --> 00:43:18.478
I don't have a home anymore.


00:43:18.646 --> 00:43:20.512
They're taking it away.


00:43:21.682 --> 00:43:25.880
I owe them 28,733 euros.
- I know.


00:43:28.790 --> 00:43:30.781
I know.


00:43:37.665 --> 00:43:39.861
I don't want to leave.


00:43:40.067 --> 00:43:42.468
I don't want to leave.


00:43:48.209 --> 00:43:50.610
What would you leave behind?


00:43:50.812 --> 00:43:53.042
I'm leaving, I am.


00:43:53.915 --> 00:43:55.246
I'll leave.


00:43:57.985 --> 00:44:00.818
A new life...


00:44:01.055 --> 00:44:03.183
A new life, right?


00:44:05.726 --> 00:44:07.125
Giacomino!


00:44:07.562 --> 00:44:11.260
Let's toast to a new life!


00:44:44.632 --> 00:44:46.430
Madonna...


00:44:52.006 --> 00:44:55.601
Make these weeks pass.


00:44:56.911 --> 00:44:59.209
Bring everything back as it was before.


00:45:00.014 --> 00:45:02.506
Bring everything back as it was before.


00:46:15.256 --> 00:46:18.191
Go on. Mom is watching.


00:46:24.532 --> 00:46:26.694
Hi, final
- Good morning!


00:46:37.678 --> 00:46:39.578
It's so hot!


00:47:31.599 --> 00:47:32.828
Angelica!


00:47:33.034 --> 00:47:34.468
Are you sleeping?


00:47:34.668 --> 00:47:38.434
Is this how you guard?
Come on, we're fishing. Quick!


00:48:10.004 --> 00:48:12.598
Show Angelica how to do it!


00:48:18.512 --> 00:48:20.412
Come on, it's late!


00:48:47.608 --> 00:48:49.406
Come on! Faster!


00:49:05.126 --> 00:49:08.858
Hurry up, please!


00:49:11.765 --> 00:49:13.233
Are you working here now?


00:49:13.601 --> 00:49:16.070
I'm doing a few days for Savino.


00:49:17.505 --> 00:49:19.872
I don't want to sell my little horses.


00:49:25.646 --> 00:49:27.705
You said you were leaving.


00:49:28.149 --> 00:49:30.413
Why aren't you nice to me?


00:49:30.618 --> 00:49:33.747
You promised you'd always be nice.
- I am nice.


00:49:36.023 --> 00:49:38.822
Maybe I found a way to keep the house.


00:49:41.028 --> 00:49:42.553
Listen...


00:49:44.765 --> 00:49:46.859
If she stirs at night, I feel it.


00:49:47.067 --> 00:49:50.628
For nine years I've felt every cough,
every flu, every drop of sweat...


00:49:50.871 --> 00:49:52.168
of my daughter.


00:49:52.540 --> 00:49:55.737
She knows I'm always there for her.
If she turns over, I'm there.


00:49:56.443 --> 00:49:58.002
It's what she needs.


00:49:58.212 --> 00:49:59.941
It heals her.


00:50:00.147 --> 00:50:01.740
I beg you!


00:50:02.783 --> 00:50:04.683
Why do you have to heal her?


00:50:04.919 --> 00:50:06.512
Is she sick?


00:50:10.591 --> 00:50:12.992
You're afraid she's like me.


00:50:15.930 --> 00:50:18.092
Tina, you know
that if she wanted to, she could...


00:50:18.465 --> 00:50:20.729
Everything's changed now.


00:50:20.968 --> 00:50:22.629
Don't you understand?


00:50:23.003 --> 00:50:26.439
I shouldn't have taken Vittoria to her.
Never!


00:50:27.241 --> 00:50:28.902
It's your fault.


00:50:29.977 --> 00:50:32.571
You can't keep her locked up.


00:50:33.647 --> 00:50:37.208
Why didn't you tell me
she works for Savino now?


00:50:37.585 --> 00:50:39.110
Are you happy?


00:50:39.920 --> 00:50:41.786
Say you're happy.


00:50:42.623 --> 00:50:44.921
So I'll start sleeping with you again.


00:50:45.125 --> 00:50:48.561
You could never accept
what's between us.


00:50:49.063 --> 00:50:51.589
It's not true. I love Vittoria.


00:50:52.967 --> 00:50:55.527
You wanted a boy
who looked like you.


00:50:55.836 --> 00:50:58.806
With those ugly ears, that crooked nose.


00:50:59.039 --> 00:51:01.906
What did your father use to say?
"She isn't one of yours."


00:51:02.943 --> 00:51:04.707
I never said that.


00:51:05.112 --> 00:51:06.739
I love Vittoria.


00:51:10.584 --> 00:51:12.484
Did you want to punish me?


00:51:12.686 --> 00:51:14.552
You wanted to punish me.


00:51:17.625 --> 00:51:19.059
Why don't you let me closer?


00:51:19.260 --> 00:51:22.093
You keep me hanging on
like a dog wagging its tail.


00:51:22.463 --> 00:51:25.125
While you two keep hugging and talking.


00:51:26.267 --> 00:51:28.497
Is she my daughter or not?


00:51:29.503 --> 00:51:30.664
The kid is suffering.


00:51:30.904 --> 00:51:34.431
I think
she has the right to know her mother.


00:51:34.642 --> 00:51:37.907
You tore my heart out
and gave it to that bitch.


00:51:39.947 --> 00:51:41.711
It isn't true, my love.


00:51:43.050 --> 00:51:44.814
We have to give her something.


00:51:45.152 --> 00:51:46.517
Everything!


00:51:46.720 --> 00:51:48.484
We have two-thousand euros


00:51:48.689 --> 00:51:50.521
and the money for Vittoria.


00:51:50.724 --> 00:51:53.250
You can sell something.
- No.


00:51:53.861 --> 00:51:55.795
Why not? Why?


00:51:56.730 --> 00:51:59.131
We're not paying for Vittoria anymore.


00:52:06.240 --> 00:52:10.177
Doesn't it die on the ground?
- Does it look like it's dying? Help me!


00:52:16.083 --> 00:52:17.642
Did you see?


00:52:18.919 --> 00:52:20.910
The smaller ones are males.


00:52:21.221 --> 00:52:23.087
This is a female.


00:52:23.924 --> 00:52:25.983
And it's really swollen.


00:52:27.528 --> 00:52:29.792
When it's ready to spawn, it changes.


00:52:30.030 --> 00:52:33.227
It turns black on top
with a silver belly.


00:52:34.535 --> 00:52:38.062
At night the females, the swollen ones,
come out of the water.


00:52:38.272 --> 00:52:40.036
They slide down to the sea


00:52:40.240 --> 00:52:42.436
and swim for days and days


00:52:42.643 --> 00:52:46.011
to that big sea in front of America.


00:52:46.213 --> 00:52:48.204
The Atlantic Ocean?


00:52:50.984 --> 00:52:52.110
Who are you?


00:52:52.486 --> 00:52:54.580
Good morning.
I caught an eel all on my own.


00:52:54.788 --> 00:52:56.882
Good girl.
And who gave you permission?


00:52:57.091 --> 00:52:59.958
Angelica.
But I'll give her 10 euros.


00:53:00.160 --> 00:53:03.721
Whose daughter are you?
- She's Umberto and Tina's daughter.


00:53:04.298 --> 00:53:05.788
Ah, right.


00:53:09.236 --> 00:53:11.898
And what are you doing
with Piras' daughter?


00:53:12.106 --> 00:53:13.596
Go, you'll be late, go!


00:53:15.676 --> 00:53:17.201
She looks like you.


00:53:18.612 --> 00:53:20.603
Listen, I'm sorry for the eel.


00:53:54.615 --> 00:53:57.949
Angelica says
they give birth far away in the ocean


00:53:58.152 --> 00:54:01.816
and the babies return to the place
where the mothers came from.


00:54:02.222 --> 00:54:03.587
Is it true?


00:54:03.791 --> 00:54:04.952
Yes.


00:54:06.160 --> 00:54:09.130
Will it also leave soon and die?


00:54:10.030 --> 00:54:12.192
I think so, it's swollen.


00:54:12.666 --> 00:54:15.067
Why does it have to go that far?


00:54:15.269 --> 00:54:17.260
Why not stay here with the babies?


00:54:17.638 --> 00:54:19.436
Doesn't it want to see them?


00:54:20.707 --> 00:54:23.199
They say man is complicated
and nature is simple.


00:54:23.577 --> 00:54:26.205
But sometimes
nature is complicated too.


00:54:37.758 --> 00:54:39.886
I knew it would end.


00:54:40.093 --> 00:54:42.687
But you can't leave me this way.
You can't!


00:54:42.930 --> 00:54:44.762
I only dream about our kisses.


00:54:44.998 --> 00:54:47.558
But I have to go now. Forgive me!


00:55:33.747 --> 00:55:36.216
The ticket... the money.


00:55:37.751 --> 00:55:39.116
Go.


00:55:57.204 --> 00:55:59.536
Take it. The ticket is there too.


00:56:12.920 --> 00:56:15.184
Aren't you coming to pay me off?


00:56:20.694 --> 00:56:23.459
Tell Vittoria you wanted to pay me off.


00:56:23.797 --> 00:56:25.162
Tell her!


00:56:42.883 --> 00:56:45.147
Tell her she wants to pay me off.


00:56:54.995 --> 00:56:57.987
Did you tell her
that it's all the money we have?


00:56:58.599 --> 00:57:01.193
That we'll send her more when we can.
Did you tell her?


00:57:01.568 --> 00:57:03.434
As long as she
doesn't see Vittoria anymore.


00:57:03.637 --> 00:57:06.732
She only wanted two-hundred euros.
- Did you tell her...


00:57:06.974 --> 00:57:08.738
There's nothing to say.


00:57:13.614 --> 00:57:15.048
She's different.


00:57:22.522 --> 00:57:24.889
Let's go away, let's leave.


00:57:25.692 --> 00:57:26.989
We'll leave.


00:57:27.194 --> 00:57:28.889
Where do you want to go?


00:57:29.096 --> 00:57:32.088
She can always prove she's her mother.


00:57:52.185 --> 00:57:53.949
Come, hold on to me.


00:58:04.131 --> 00:58:05.895
You have to breathe inside.


00:58:06.099 --> 00:58:08.796
Not with the nose,
but inside, understand?


00:58:18.178 --> 00:58:19.646
Breathe inside.


00:58:28.855 --> 00:58:30.721
Did you breathe like I told you?


00:58:30.957 --> 00:58:32.083
Yes, inside.


00:58:32.459 --> 00:58:33.551
Good girl.


00:58:34.061 --> 00:58:36.860
Don't be afraid
when there is less air.


00:58:43.570 --> 00:58:46.471
Usually the most beautiful things
are near the dead.


00:58:46.673 --> 00:58:49.643
But you shouldn't wake the dead.
- Why not?


00:58:50.077 --> 00:58:52.671
Maybe they like a little company.


00:58:53.747 --> 00:58:56.876
It's just bones, don't be afraid.


00:58:59.653 --> 00:59:03.453
Everything goes round
and everything returns to how it was.


00:59:03.824 --> 00:59:05.121
Come.


00:59:13.100 --> 00:59:14.625
You see there?


00:59:15.102 --> 00:59:16.729
Down there in the back.


00:59:17.504 --> 00:59:21.134
That's where they found
the statuette of that tat woman.


00:59:22.776 --> 00:59:26.474
It's this big,
but it's worth a lot of money.


00:59:28.849 --> 00:59:31.511
You're my mother, aren't you?


00:59:42.129 --> 00:59:43.619
More or less.


00:59:44.164 --> 00:59:47.156
Did you leave me
because I was ugly and stupid?


00:59:49.102 --> 00:59:50.467
Yup.


00:59:53.039 --> 00:59:55.030
But you're getting better.


00:59:56.743 --> 00:59:58.734
Can I ask you a question?


01:00:01.448 --> 01:00:02.677
An easy one.


01:00:02.916 --> 01:00:05.544
How do you hold your mouth when you kiss?


01:01:11.184 --> 01:01:13.983
Listen, I don't know why I left you.


01:01:14.688 --> 01:01:16.019
Who knows?


01:01:18.725 --> 01:01:21.023
I was just back in town after years.


01:01:21.228 --> 01:01:22.559
I was really pregnant.


01:01:22.762 --> 01:01:25.561
I was late to my mother's funeral.


01:01:27.901 --> 01:01:30.927
Tina got there
while I was about to give birth.


01:01:31.137 --> 01:01:33.538
I'd have died if it wasn't for her.


01:01:37.711 --> 01:01:39.736
And she helped you into this world.


01:01:42.782 --> 01:01:44.580
You were,


01:01:45.151 --> 01:01:46.983
you were something,


01:01:47.754 --> 01:01:51.486
you were so very small and dirty.


01:01:53.226 --> 01:01:55.593
Everyone says I'm no good at anything.


01:01:55.795 --> 01:01:58.492
But Tina took you and cleaned you.


01:01:58.698 --> 01:02:00.132
All those things.


01:02:04.104 --> 01:02:06.766
It was clear
she wanted you very much.


01:02:07.007 --> 01:02:10.136
You can do so many things. She's a liar.
- No!


01:02:10.510 --> 01:02:11.807
No.


01:02:12.512 --> 01:02:13.809
Don't.


01:02:14.047 --> 01:02:16.038
Don't say that about Tina.


01:02:16.249 --> 01:02:17.774
You're a liar as well.


01:02:18.018 --> 01:02:22.046
You said she was happy you were coming
but I know it's not true.


01:02:24.257 --> 01:02:25.725
She's good.


01:02:57.757 --> 01:02:59.623
Angelica!


01:03:31.524 --> 01:03:33.117
Give me a drink.


01:03:35.128 --> 01:03:37.028
It's not good for you.


01:03:41.601 --> 01:03:43.091
Give it to me.


01:03:49.075 --> 01:03:51.043
Just this one, OK?


01:03:55.782 --> 01:03:57.147
That's enough...


01:04:02.722 --> 01:04:04.212
Did you tell her?


01:04:06.993 --> 01:04:08.620
You told her!


01:04:16.703 --> 01:04:18.501
You don't understand.


01:04:19.139 --> 01:04:21.631
She doesn't look at me in the same way.


01:04:29.916 --> 01:04:34.080
I used to hold her so tightly at night.


01:04:35.488 --> 01:04:37.650
I sniffed her little feet.


01:04:39.926 --> 01:04:42.418
Nothing could ever happen to her.


01:04:43.463 --> 01:04:46.091
Now I can't hug her anymore.


01:04:47.967 --> 01:04:50.629
Why?
Why did you do this to me?


01:04:51.738 --> 01:04:53.797
Why did you do this to me?


01:05:00.146 --> 01:05:01.739
Slowly.


01:05:02.916 --> 01:05:04.475
Slowly.


01:05:07.954 --> 01:05:09.479
Why?


01:05:12.959 --> 01:05:15.621
She could've been better
than the two of us.


01:05:21.067 --> 01:05:22.557
Why?


01:05:27.574 --> 01:05:29.565
She's the one who said it.


01:05:36.483 --> 01:05:37.882
I hate you.


01:05:42.922 --> 01:05:44.412
I hate you.


01:05:44.724 --> 01:05:45.953
Do you hear me?


01:08:08.835 --> 01:08:11.429
Did you bring the money?


01:08:15.108 --> 01:08:16.906
What day is today?


01:08:17.543 --> 01:08:20.171
What?
- I said, what day is today?


01:08:22.215 --> 01:08:23.944
The 20th.


01:08:24.617 --> 01:08:26.415
Yeah, right. The 20th.


01:09:36.089 --> 01:09:37.955
Slowly...


01:09:55.208 --> 01:09:56.937
Look at her.


01:09:57.210 --> 01:10:00.612
A drunkard,
just a poor whore.


01:10:01.180 --> 01:10:03.205
Leave her alone!
- Vittoria! Don't touch her!


01:10:03.583 --> 01:10:05.073
Take the kid away.


01:10:05.451 --> 01:10:07.010
Vittoria!


01:10:07.220 --> 01:10:10.121
Calm down, stop it.
Go away.


01:10:10.823 --> 01:10:12.086
Are you hurt?


01:10:12.458 --> 01:10:14.153
You're crazy! Fuck!


01:10:16.796 --> 01:10:18.195
Franco!


01:10:21.100 --> 01:10:22.568
Let's go home.


01:10:22.769 --> 01:10:24.760
I'm not coming with you.


01:10:26.806 --> 01:10:29.935
Why did you bring her here?
- You bought me.


01:10:30.243 --> 01:10:33.076
You don't care about me
or about what I want.


01:10:33.279 --> 01:10:36.681
You hate me because I'm not like you,
you don't like me.


01:10:37.583 --> 01:10:39.915
I don't hate you. I...


01:10:40.720 --> 01:10:43.519
Don't touch me.
- I love you so much.


01:10:43.723 --> 01:10:46.249
And don't touch her either!
Liar!


01:10:46.626 --> 01:10:49.960
You're the most important thing.
Come with me. Come!


01:10:53.533 --> 01:10:54.967
Go away!


01:10:57.537 --> 01:10:58.936
Go away!


01:11:24.530 --> 01:11:25.998
Did he hurt you?


01:11:26.732 --> 01:11:28.063
Swear.
- I swear.


01:11:28.267 --> 01:11:29.928
Your knees?


01:11:32.805 --> 01:11:34.637
He isn't bad.


01:11:35.775 --> 01:11:38.870
He was excited
because he wanted me so much.


01:11:40.046 --> 01:11:41.707
He's...


01:11:43.749 --> 01:11:46.116
my fiancé.


01:11:48.287 --> 01:11:51.689
And you... sent him away.


01:11:54.794 --> 01:11:57.729
I'm here now.
Let's go home, Mom.


01:12:13.746 --> 01:12:15.145
Franco...


01:12:24.957 --> 01:12:27.119
Move away, I stink.


01:13:02.194 --> 01:13:05.095
Sorry if I made you make a mistake.


01:14:03.789 --> 01:14:06.224
We have to eat breakfast and all.


01:14:10.096 --> 01:14:13.964
I don't have a lot at home,
I almost never have breakfast.


01:14:23.442 --> 01:14:26.434
I have this,
it's good, it tastes of orange.


01:14:28.014 --> 01:14:29.982
Look, it bubbles.


01:14:40.493 --> 01:14:41.858
Go sit there.


01:14:52.471 --> 01:14:53.939
Don't you want this?


01:14:54.640 --> 01:14:56.039
It's good.


01:15:13.726 --> 01:15:15.455
That's enough, thanks.


01:15:15.661 --> 01:15:18.528
Don't you like beans?
- Very much, thank you.


01:15:18.998 --> 01:15:20.762
I do too.


01:15:34.680 --> 01:15:37.411
Enjoy your meal.
- Enjoy.


01:16:12.151 --> 01:16:15.018
What a belly!
When are your puppies coming out?


01:16:15.221 --> 01:16:16.518
Luciana, get out!


01:16:16.722 --> 01:16:18.087
Luciana!
- Get out.


01:16:18.290 --> 01:16:19.917
Come on, Lucianina.


01:16:20.493 --> 01:16:22.120
Look at this, Luciana.


01:16:27.433 --> 01:16:29.492
Come Luciana, let's play.


01:16:29.702 --> 01:16:32.000
Luciana, look at the stick!


01:16:41.247 --> 01:16:43.011
Look at this, Luciana.


01:16:46.552 --> 01:16:48.646
Lucianina, come on, let's play.


01:17:10.242 --> 01:17:12.074
May I call Mom?


01:17:16.248 --> 01:17:17.875
Yes... Sure.


01:17:18.217 --> 01:17:19.651
Stay there.


01:17:27.026 --> 01:17:28.858
Go away!


01:17:29.862 --> 01:17:31.091
Here.


01:17:42.808 --> 01:17:46.176
Mom...
- Vittoria! Have you eaten?


01:17:46.946 --> 01:17:48.846
Yes, I have eaten.


01:17:50.082 --> 01:17:52.574
May I call you Mom?


01:17:53.452 --> 01:17:54.851
My love!


01:17:57.022 --> 01:17:59.548
Did you watch "Hurricane of Love"?


01:17:59.959 --> 01:18:04.863
No, we'll watch it together
when you come back.


01:18:06.265 --> 01:18:08.131
Everything's ready here.


01:18:08.500 --> 01:18:11.162
Your friends
will all be here soon for you.


01:18:11.537 --> 01:18:13.062
Nobody will come.


01:18:13.272 --> 01:18:15.866
Sure they will.
They're all coming.


01:18:18.244 --> 01:18:19.678
Vittoria...


01:18:19.912 --> 01:18:22.540
I have to go now. Bye.
- Love...


01:18:37.463 --> 01:18:40.524
Where is Vittoria?
- She'll be right here.


01:18:40.933 --> 01:18:42.423
She turns ten?


01:18:42.635 --> 01:18:44.626
Yes, don't you know that?


01:18:49.541 --> 01:18:51.134
A little higher.


01:19:06.125 --> 01:19:08.093
I don't think she'll show up!


01:19:23.042 --> 01:19:26.137
I tied the horses as you asked.


01:19:31.183 --> 01:19:32.673
Let's go.


01:19:43.028 --> 01:19:45.395
Where are we going?
- Shut up.


01:19:47.433 --> 01:19:50.403
Are you all right?
- I told you to shut up.


01:19:51.070 --> 01:19:52.902
My head's bursting.


01:20:06.585 --> 01:20:08.019
Here...


01:20:11.123 --> 01:20:12.613
Here it is.


01:20:13.692 --> 01:20:15.558
What's in there?


01:20:16.128 --> 01:20:18.495
I don't know.
A treasure, they say.


01:20:18.697 --> 01:20:20.859
Do we have to go in?


01:20:21.900 --> 01:20:23.231
You're going in.


01:20:23.602 --> 01:20:26.071
I can't get through, it's too narrow.


01:20:28.273 --> 01:20:31.004
I taught you everything you need.


01:20:31.477 --> 01:20:34.913
Zero fear of void.
Hold your breath, breathe inside.


01:20:35.114 --> 01:20:37.879
Then push and you'll get out again.


01:20:39.485 --> 01:20:40.680
Go.


01:20:40.919 --> 01:20:43.786
Has anybody ever gone in?
- No.


01:20:46.725 --> 01:20:47.954
Go.


01:20:54.666 --> 01:20:56.031
Well?


01:20:56.969 --> 01:20:58.494
What's the matter?


01:21:00.139 --> 01:21:02.938
What's the matter?
What did you expect?


01:21:04.777 --> 01:21:05.972
Go!


01:21:11.750 --> 01:21:15.277
This is what I am. You shouldn't have
expected anything from me!


01:21:15.654 --> 01:21:17.713
I'm like the earth when it rains,


01:21:17.956 --> 01:21:20.186
the closer you get the more you sink.


01:21:20.559 --> 01:21:24.621
I need money.
I've got nothing, I've got nobody.


01:21:24.830 --> 01:21:27.162
I can't lose the house as well.


01:21:27.533 --> 01:21:30.764
I wanted to sell the horses
but you made that face, so nothing...


01:21:31.003 --> 01:21:34.029
What now?
Shit, it's your fault! Get it?


01:21:34.239 --> 01:21:37.004
Go, go away!
Go away!


01:21:37.209 --> 01:21:39.803
Go!
Tina's right.


01:21:40.045 --> 01:21:43.675
I never wanted you, never!
You can't do anything, you can only cry!


01:21:43.916 --> 01:21:45.441
Cry, little Madonna, cry!


01:21:45.651 --> 01:21:48.120
You're ugly, stupid, useless!


01:21:48.487 --> 01:21:50.581
Go!
- I hate you and I curse you!


01:21:50.789 --> 01:21:52.587
I curse you all! Liars!


01:21:52.791 --> 01:21:54.156
Out!


01:21:54.526 --> 01:21:56.119
You're useless!


01:21:56.495 --> 01:21:58.520
You useless kid!


01:22:02.835 --> 01:22:05.463
You can't even go into a hole!


01:24:50.102 --> 01:24:52.537
I don't have your money.
- Let me go!


01:24:52.738 --> 01:24:56.038
You all make me sick,
you and your shitty money!


01:24:56.775 --> 01:24:58.243
Stop it now.


01:25:00.212 --> 01:25:01.702
What are you doing?


01:25:02.481 --> 01:25:05.610
No, no...
- If you don't pay me, they're mine.


01:25:05.817 --> 01:25:07.546
No, they're...
- They are mine!


01:25:07.753 --> 01:25:10.779
They are Vittoria's horses,
don't touch them.


01:25:12.090 --> 01:25:13.956
I said don't touch them!
- Stop it!


01:25:14.159 --> 01:25:15.627
She loves them.


01:25:17.529 --> 01:25:18.928
Stop it!


01:26:59.831 --> 01:27:02.425
What happened? Vittoria!


01:27:07.472 --> 01:27:10.442
What happened? Where is Vittoria?


01:27:12.544 --> 01:27:14.535
What happened? Where is she?


01:27:21.553 --> 01:27:24.113
I asked her to go into the hole...
- A hole?


01:27:24.489 --> 01:27:26.924
At the necropolis.


01:28:09.201 --> 01:28:11.033
Vittoria!


01:28:30.055 --> 01:28:31.614
Excuse me!


01:28:35.927 --> 01:28:38.453
Have you seen a girl?


01:28:38.663 --> 01:28:40.961
A little girl with red hair?


01:28:41.533 --> 01:28:45.436
My daughter Vittoria is in danger.


01:31:25.096 --> 01:31:26.586
Are you all right?


01:31:27.632 --> 01:31:30.761
I went all the way down
the deepest hole.


01:31:31.002 --> 01:31:32.231
Alone!


01:31:32.904 --> 01:31:36.772
You did great.
You're always the best for me.


01:31:41.546 --> 01:31:43.708
Happy birthday.


01:31:45.750 --> 01:31:49.778
You've really grown up.
Sweetheart.


01:31:54.693 --> 01:31:56.092
Here we are.


01:31:58.663 --> 01:32:00.256
It hurts.


01:32:12.043 --> 01:32:13.841
Wait.


01:32:22.554 --> 01:32:24.955
Did you really get in?
- Yes.


01:32:25.156 --> 01:32:28.126
I also got out,
but there was nothing down there.


01:32:40.839 --> 01:32:42.204
Come here.


01:32:43.808 --> 01:32:45.003
It's water.


01:32:45.210 --> 01:32:47.076
It burns.
- It's water.


01:32:57.555 --> 01:32:59.080
Let's go!


01:33:14.773 --> 01:33:16.207
Let's go!

